{
  "id": "intermittent_combustion_and_boiler_efficiency",
  "title": "Intermittent Combustion and Boiler Efficiency",
  "description": "Efficiency reduction due to intermittent boiler operation",
  "type": "calculator-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Intermittent Combustion and Boiler Efficiency\n\nBoiler combustion efficiency is reduced by intermittent operation due to:\n\n- **Energy loss in the flue gas** - either by unburned fuel with the excess of fuel or by heating more air than necessary with the excess of air\n- **Radiation and convection loss** from the exterior surface of the boiler\n\nEnergy loss due to radiation and convection increases with intermittent operation and reduced combustion time."
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "continuous_efficiency",
          "label": "Continuous Operation Efficiency",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "%",
          "defaultValue": 85
        },
        {
          "id": "operating_hours_per_day",
          "label": "Operating Hours per Day",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "hours",
          "defaultValue": 8
        },
        {
          "id": "standby_loss_percent",
          "label": "Standby Loss Rate",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "%",
          "defaultValue": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "radiation_convection_loss",
          "label": "Radiation and Convection Loss",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "%",
          "defaultValue": 5
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "operating_fraction",
          "label": "Daily Operating Fraction",
          "formula": "inputs.operating_hours_per_day / 24",
          "unit": "",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "standby_fraction",
          "label": "Daily Standby Fraction",
          "formula": "(24 - inputs.operating_hours_per_day) / 24",
          "unit": "",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "effective_standby_loss",
          "label": "Effective Standby Loss",
          "formula": "(inputs.standby_loss_percent * (24 - inputs.operating_hours_per_day)) / 24",
          "unit": "%",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "intermittent_efficiency",
          "label": "Intermittent Operation Efficiency",
          "formula": "inputs.continuous_efficiency - inputs.radiation_convection_loss - inputs.standby_loss_percent * ((24 - inputs.operating_hours_per_day) / 24)",
          "unit": "%",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "efficiency_reduction",
          "label": "Efficiency Reduction",
          "formula": "inputs.continuous_efficiency - (inputs.continuous_efficiency - inputs.radiation_convection_loss - inputs.standby_loss_percent * ((24 - inputs.operating_hours_per_day) / 24))",
          "unit": "%",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}